{
  "$comment": "团队共享层。个人机器的设置放 .claude/settings.local.json（已 gitignore）。",
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(xcodebuild:*)",
      "Bash(xcrun devicectl:*)",
      "Bash(xcrun xctrace:*)",
      "Bash(openspec:*)",
      "Bash(node scripts/*)",
      "Bash(scripts/device-test.sh:*)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Read(./docs/_archive-*.bak)",
      "Edit(./Podfile)",
      "Edit(./LocalConfig.xcconfig)"
    ]
  },
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write|Read",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hooks/guard.mjs\" pre"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$comment": "共享 checkout 的 git 安全网：.git 整个是共用的（HEAD 也是）。拦「改写别人分支的历史」与「不带显式路径的暂存」两类。",
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hooks/shared-checkout-guard.mjs\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$comment": "动 SwiftUI 视图前把 docs/ui/design-direction.md 的四步流程灌回来。每会话只响一次，且只在真的改视图时响（改 Service/Model/测试不响）。非阻断——设计流程走没走没有机器判据，拦不了只能提醒。",
        "matcher": "Edit|Write",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hooks/design-direction-reminder.mjs\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$comment": "联网调研前把 docs/research/INDEX.md 灌回来：先查记录，缺的那段才重搜。",
        "matcher": "WebSearch|WebFetch|mcp__firecrawl__.*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hooks/research-log.mjs\" pre"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hooks/guard.mjs\" post"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hooks/session-context.mjs\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/scripts/hooks/stop-checklist.mjs\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
